  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline ENSO PRO is a slick round co-polyester built for pure put-away power, precise ball placement and superior pocketing. Its low-friction surface maximizes snapback, while the round geometry provides a clean and predictable response for aggressive ball strikers. ENSO PRO combines explosive pace with comfort and connected feel, making it suitable both as a full-bed power string and as a slick hybrid cross. It is available in Neon Pink 1.24 mm and Carbon Gray 1.25 mm, both listed as 16L.",

    "zh": "Toroline ENSO PRO 是一款强调 Pure Put-Away Power、精准落点和强 Pocketing 的圆形低摩擦共聚酯球线。光滑表面能够最大化 Snapback，而对称圆形结构则提供干净、可预测并且具有穿透力的击球反馈。ENSO PRO 特别适合主动进攻型 Ball Striker，在提供爆发速度的同时兼顾舒适性和 Connected Feel。它既适合整床使用，也可以作为异形主线的低摩擦力量型横线。目前提供 Neon Pink 1.24 毫米和 Carbon Gray 1.25 毫米两个版本，官方均标记为 16L。"
  },

